    {
      "where": "training(ona-training)",
      "key": "content",
      "value": "ONA Coffee goes above and beyond as a coffee bean wholesale supplier. When you choose our wholesale coffee beans, you gain access to world-class training programs that empower your team and elevate your café's coffee experience. Discover more about our programs — exclusive to our wholesale clients."
    },
    {
      "where": "training(ona-training)",
      "key": "content@href",
      "value": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dktspYuqEIg"
    },
    {
