    },
    {
      "where": "training(ona-training)/8567fbfe-f6c8-48ca-abc9-931b07259ff2",
      "key": "title",
      "value": "barista training"
    },
    {
      "where": "training(ona-training)/8567fbfe-f6c8-48ca-abc9-931b07259ff2",
      "key": "content",
      "value": "Our barista training covers everything from long-standing, tried-and-tested fundamental coffee knowledge to the most current techniques to set your café apart."
    },
    {
      "where": "training(ona-training)/0aa8bb1c-edcf-4f19-a895-faf0284848c2",
      "key": "title",
      "value": "excellence program"
    },
    {
      "where": "training(ona-training)/0aa8bb1c-edcf-4f19-a895-faf0284848c2",
      "key": "content",
      "value": "Our one-of-a-kind 'Excellence Program' covers best-practice foundational principles, all the way to competition-level, boundary-pushing innovations to elevate your knowledge and distinguish you as a leader in the coffee industry.\nThis three-stage coffee training system meets your team exactly where they are and takes them further. Here's how our step-by-step training system gives café teams a clear path forward and ensures your coffee service grows stronger at every level:\nStage 1: Foundation covers essential skills for baristas just starting out.\nStage 2: Progressive dives deeper into specialty techniques like frozen coffee, filter brewing and advanced workflow.\nStage 3: Professional unlocks boundary-pushing, competition-level methods that raise your café’s profile and elevate what’s possible behind the bar."
    },
    {
      "where": "training(ona-training)/2e827d35-3bcf-4dc8-8599-9f29284efa1d",
      "key": "title",
      "value": "research and development"
    },
    {
      "where": "training(ona-training)/2e827d35-3bcf-4dc8-8599-9f29284efa1d",
      "key": "content",
      "value": "Explore innovation with ONA Coffee's Research and Development Program. Led by our expert sales team, we examine new and established coffee topics. We rigorously test current practices, explore new areas and share valuable insights. Here's how we turn research into real-world impact:\nInnovation that fuels growth — Our R&D Program drives innovation across everything we teach and do. Each month, we rigorously test current best practices, explore emerging ideas and feed those findings directly into our training and Masterclasses. This ensures every wholesale coffee partner has access to industry-leading support and the most up-to-date thinking in coffee today.\nMasterclasses — In 2024, we relaunched our Masterclasses, which are in-person events planned exclusively for our café partners. These immersive sessions go beyond the everyday to explore advanced techniques, flavour development and the broader culture of specialty coffee. It’s also a chance to connect, cup and learn together with others in the ONA community at our flagship venues."
    },
