      "value": "Are you interested in taking your coffee career to the next level? As an ONA wholesale coffee partner, our team of coffee professionals will coach and guide you through the world of coffee competition"
    },
    {
      "where": "wholesale_sourcing_v5(ona-wholesale-sourcing-v5)",
      "key": "image",
      "value": "shopify://shop_images/4_a01b08af-a94c-4a7d-98a0-456a0361728d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "where": "wholesale_sourcing_v5(ona-wholesale-sourcing-v5)",
      "key": "subtitle",
      "value": "What Sets Our Program and Wholesale Coffee Partnerships Apart"
    },
    {
      "where": "wholesale_sourcing_v5(ona-wholesale-sourcing-v5)",
      "key": "content",
      "value": "At ONA Coffee, we believe being great coffee wholesalers means offering more than just exceptional beans — it’s about empowering every café we work with to grow, innovate and lead. That’s why we’ve developed one of the most comprehensive coffee education ecosystems in Australia, available only to our wholesale coffee partners.\nHere’s why our wholesale clients keep choosing us as their coffee supplier of choice:\nWe give back to the coffee community through ongoing education, events and long-term partnerships.\nWe push the boundaries with advanced training and forward-thinking techniques that elevate every aspect of your coffee program.\nWe innovate with purpose, pioneering methods like frozen specialty coffee and driving change through our R&D program.\nWe stay current and challenge norms, rigorously testing new ideas while ensuring best practices are always upheld.\nWe offer one of the most curated coffee selections in the industry, including rare single origins, seasonal rotations and reserve lots.\nWe grow café teams systematically with our step-by-step Excellence Program tailored to every experience level.\nWe support your business holistically, from barista development and equipment advice to marketing and technical support.\nWe create meaningful connections through Masterclasses, flagship café events and personal account management."
    },
    {
      "where": "wholesale_testimonial(ona-wholesale-testimonial)",
      "key": "id",
      "value": "testimomnial-block"
    },
    {
      "where": "wholesale_testimonial(ona-wholesale-testimonial)",
