      "value": "Café Partners Testimonials"
    },
    {
      "where": "wholesale_testimonial(ona-wholesale-testimonial)",
      "key": "content",
      "value": "We value our café partnerships. Our upcoming video spills the beans on the incredible friendships we've brewed with some of our café partners. We're shining a light on those legendary teams that have been rocking our coffee scene for ages. It's not just about pouring the perfect cup – it's about the laughs, the conversations, and the caffeinated love we've shared along the way."
    },
