      "value": "Choosing Ona Coffee for Cafe Faducci over the past five years, has been one of the best decisions we've made.\nTheir commitment to sourcing the finest beans and their unwavering dedication to quality is evident in every cup we serve.\nOur customers continually rave about the rich, complex flavours of Ona Coffee, make it a cornerstone of our cafe's success."
