    {
      "where": "wholesale_sourcing_v6(ona-wholesale-sourcing-v6)",
      "key": "content",
      "value": "Hey there!\nWe're all about meaningful partnerships, so we have something exciting for you. How about featuring our coffee as a guest in your shop for a one-month trial? You'll receive full wholesale benefits and dive into our fantastic coffee range. We're sure you'll love ONA Coffee, and we're excited about the possibility of partnering with your café. Ready to explore world-class coffee together? Let us know! You’ll get a true taste of what sets us apart as coffee beans wholesale suppliers — not just in the cup but in the care, service and support we bring to the table."
